<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-EGYPT'S ZAMALEK WIN AFRICAN SUPER CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EGYPT'S ZAMALEK WIN AFRICAN SUPER CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zamalek won the African Super Cup</p>
<p>on Friday when they beat Egyptian rivals Arab Contractors 4-2 on</p>
<p>penalties after the match ended 0-0 after extra time.</p>
</text>
